[NAV] 1. Navigate to GraphQL playground: {{BACK_URL}}/ui/graphiql
[ACT] 2. Execute whiteLabelingSettings query with both footerLinks and mainMenuLinks fields (cultureName is REQUIRED — omitting it returns empty arrays even though configured):
